WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:04.193
The Display Control Unit is the scan processor itself.

2
00:00:04.193 --> 00:00:06.588
It decides where every line is drawn.

3
00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:09.607
H Size and V Size stretch the raster.

4
00:00:09.607 --> 00:00:12.511
H Position and V Position slide it around.

5
00:00:15.355 --> 00:00:18.869
Z Push is depth: how far bright areas lift toward you.

6
00:00:18.869 --> 00:00:21.797
Z Bias moves the whole sheet forward or back.

7
00:00:22.261 --> 00:00:24.885
Rotation turns the raster in its own plane.

8
00:00:26.388 --> 00:00:28.969
V Spin turns it around its vertical axis.

9
00:00:30.419 --> 00:00:35.240
Threshold hides the darkest parts of the picture, so only the brighter areas draw.

10
00:00:35.691 --> 00:00:38.315
Intensity sets the brightness of the beam.

11
00:00:38.315 --> 00:00:40.128
Focus softens or sharpens it.

12
00:00:43.472 --> 00:00:45.898
Double-click any knob to put it back.

13
00:00:45.898 --> 00:00:47.930
Next: color, glow, and presets.
